This file describes the contents of concord/doc. This directory contains
the original preprint of the concord paper, and the code documentation.

The code documentation source is provided in source/index.rst, and can be
generated automatically with sphinx; type

make html

and copy the contents of the html directory to an appropriate remote site
(currently https://burst.sci.monash.edu/concord)
